Arch Linux ARM's socat (1.8.1.3-2, 2026-11-24) needs openssl 4 (libssl.so=4); the rootfs and the phone have openssl
3.6, and pulling openssl 4 in breaks sudo's libssl.so=3 (pacman refused: "installing openssl (4.1.0-1) breaks
dependency 'libssl.so=3-64' required by sudo"). Built against the rootfs's own openssl instead.
